A free vote is far from a "farce".

The problem is that there is no other democratic forum for discussing
such issues.  It seems there's a hundred or so votes in so far, and
if, say, 80+ of these are in favour of either course of action the
development team should take note of that strong body of opinion.

I'd rather see a vote than 100 messages on this board, and if you
can't tolerate the freedom of a referendum, that's your problem.
I hope the team are more tolerant and less childish than you.

